      <activity id="f9b210de-fd4a-52ae-bc25-5c93ca1ad100" activityNameId="fbcbd00d-29aa-504d-8449-9c54bee56e09" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Door, inner, aluminium, transparent filling, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Door, inner, aluminium, transparent filling, at regional storage
The share of imported aluminium doors was estimated at 25%. The production of imported doors is modelled by the dataset for Switzerland including a 10% surcharge. The main countries of origin are Germany and Poland. The average transport distance was estimated based on the geographic centre of these countries.;
UUID: e0ee9db1-667d-3e92-9b7c-9bd5ce89d0c5
Included are the production of inner doors with transparent filling and the transport of imported doors to a regional storage in Switzerland.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimate by a producer of aluminium doors. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e0ee9db1-667d-3e92-9b7c-9bd5ce89d0c5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
